      "instance_name": "reproductive_rights",
      "label": "Reproductive Rights",
      "description": "A social and political movement advocating for the right of individuals to make autonomous decisions about their reproductive health, including access to contraception and abortion. This concept is central to the meme's message of 'keep it legal' and 'keep it affordable'.",
