      "instance_name": "childlike_letters",
      "label": "Childlike Letters",
      "description": "The use of colorful, blocky, childlike letters for the word 'ABORTION' is a visual metaphor. It may imply that abortion is a simple, basic, or even trivial procedure, or it may be used to contrast the clinical nature of the stethoscope with the emotional or moral weight of the word, suggesting a need for normalization or destigmatization.",
