      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "legalization_of_abortion",
      "label": "Legalization of Abortion",
      "description": "The process by which a government or legal system permits abortion under certain conditions. The phrase 'keep it legal' directly references this concept, which is a central goal of many reproductive rights organizations and is often the subject of political debate.",
