      "instance_name": "affordability_of_healthcare",
      "label": "Affordability of Healthcare",
      "description": "The concept that medical services should be financially accessible to all individuals, regardless of income. The phrase 'keep it affordable!' references this principle, which is a key concern in healthcare policy debates, especially regarding reproductive health services.",
