      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_6b1aacdd",
      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_legal_abortion",
      "label": "Abortion is a legal medical procedure",
      "description": "The text 'keep it legal.' is mapped onto the stethoscope, which symbolizes medical care and professionalism. This mapping implies that abortion, like other medical procedures, should be legally recognized and regulated within the healthcare system. The stethoscope visually represents the medical legitimacy of abortion, aligning with the textual advocacy for its legalization.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
